               ],
               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "Woodmine - is a small town in the middle of beautiful nowhere. It was built around, you guessed it right, woods and mines by simple workers in the early 18th century. And some of them are still working! Not much has changed since then if you ask me. People are still simple and even kinda cozy in a way away from big city noise. There is a boring super mall with goods and tech, but common folks prefer to use their farm market and party like it 1835 in Miners's Rest Tavern. 'The Uncle's Steve Adventure Shop' is also there. And yeah, there are rumors about the ManBearPig-style stuff and other mysteries like historical artifacts, lost treasures, and ghosts of the past!",
