               "content": "Hartley's family roots deep in Woodmine town. They were one of the first workers who decided to settle fully in this place. As of today, Hartley's family consists of patriarch Rick Hartley, matriarch Evelyn Hartley, Jeff Hartley, Jimm Hartley, and Jacklyn Hartley. The older brother Jeff decided to follow father's steps and serve in the military, while Jimm picked to get an education in Seattle.",
