               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "Cedar Creek Falls is a beautiful, secluded waterfall hidden deep in the forest. The falls cascade down into a clear, refreshing pool surrounded by smooth, moss-covered rocks. It's a popular spot for locals to swim and relax, though reaching it requires a bit of a hike. Or a heck of a hike for city folks. Local legends say that there must be an entrance into the Hidden Grove, ancient and untouched by civilizations... or to the hidden pirate bay where government hides UFO - depends on the time of the week. Still, Cedar Creek Falls is a great place to swim and chillax.",
