               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "Hidden Grove is a highly secluded grove hidden deep within the forest. It is filled with ancient trees and a carpet of soft moss. The air here is cool and still, with a faint, otherworldly glow filtering through the canopy. It's a place of peace and beauty, seemingly untouched by time. Oh... you don't need to hear what kind of crazy tales local folks sing about this place, trust me. But one tale will be interesting, as it says that Grace Hartley is the last one who managed to find it and make a deal with local spirits. But what kind of deal?",
