               ],
               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "Woodmine town is in the middle of the secluded area covered by lush forest and tall mountains. It placed in the middle of this area. You will find some kind of civilization there, with a singular boring super mall with electronics, Uncle Steve's Adventure Shop, Miner's Rest Tavern, local clinic, and farm market. Around the town you will find forest, nature, Airfield, Old Mill, more forest, Hartley's Farm, mountains, caves, Ruby mines, old but working mines, other farms, fields, rivers, Cedar Creek Falls, and yes, more forest. But if you feel really lucky or just lost enough, you may find Sunset Ridge Lookout or even legendary Hidden Grove, or even more legendary Crystal Cave! Depends.",
