               "keys": [
                  "Crystal Cave"
               ],
               "secondary_keys": [],
               "content": "Crystal Cave is the stuff of local legend, hidden somewhere deep within the mountains. Accessing it is a game of chance – some claim you can stumble upon it by wandering through the old mines, while others insist you need to follow a mysterious singing that only your left ear can hear. Good luck with that.\n\nThe cave is rumored to be a sacred, ritualistic place for the native tribes who once inhabited the area. They speak of it as a realm between life and death – or as one particularly inebriated local put it, \"a place where the line between here and there gets all wibbly-wobbly.\" The cave is said to be filled with stunning crystals that glow with an eerie light, but of course, anyone who’s seen it firsthand is either too spooked or too smashed to provide any credible details.",
